    {
      "step": "drawer",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "ACQUIRED",
      "line": "Ratchet's battery — His own battery, hidden in his drawer. Wire it back into the empty socket in his chest to wake him.",
      "art": "repairBattery",
      "demo": null
    },
    {
      "step": "drawer",
      "room": "A0B",
      "panels": "drawer",
      "cap": "pc_drawer",
      "line": ""
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "His chest socket is empty. Wire his battery back in."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "…My own battery. You put it back. Thank you, little one — I’m Ratchet."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "Mother’s song was infected. This marble on my necklace slowed the virus. It could not stop it."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "So I took my battery out before it took me. You were asleep in a recharge cradle — you never heard the broadcast."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "Under the meadow lies a big deposit of raw marble. Bring me a piece, and I’ll forge a white sword that cuts the virus out."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "One more thing: this spare Power Cell is not for you. It’s for Old Servo, out in the meadow. He switched himself off too. Wake him."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "ACQUIRED",
      "line": "Spare Power Cell — Ratchet’s spare, for Old Servo, the winch-keeper in the meadow. Seat it in him to wake him.",
      "art": "spareCell",
      "demo": null
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "This pod saves your progress and recharges you. Use it before you leave."
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "panels": "ratchet",
      "cap": "pc_r_cell",
      "line": ""
    },
    {
      "step": "repair",
      "room": "A0B",
      "panels": "ratchet",
      "cap": "pc_r_marble",
      "line": ""
    },
    {
      "step": "pack",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "That ring of charge on you fills when your hits land. Right now you have no way to spend it."
    },
    {
      "step": "pack",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "My Volt Pack fixes that. With it, hold F to mend a core, or hold X and let go for a Volt Burst."
    },
    {
      "step": "pack",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "You will need the burst — claws alone won’t crack raw marble. The pack is yours for good. It costs 12 scrap."
    },
    {
      "step": "pack",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "Ratchet",
      "line": "You have no scrap, so take 12 for fixing me. Scrap is the money down here: broken machines leave it behind."
    },
    {
      "step": "pack",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "ACQUIRED",
      "line": "12 Scrap — The money down here. Broken machines leave it behind; Ratchet takes it for parts and upgrades.",
      "art": "scrapPile",
      "demo": null
    },
    {
      "step": "pack",
      "room": "A0B",
      "name": "ACQUIRED",
      "line": "Volt Pack (permanent) — Ratchet’s charger, wired into you for good. Hold F to spend volts mending a core. Hold X and let go to spend them on a Volt Burst.",
      "art": null,
      "demo": "pack"
    }
  ],
